const items=[['overview','◫','Overview'],['creative','✦','Creative direction'],['calendar','▦','Content calendar'],['studio','▷','Content studio'],['approvals','✓','Approvals'],['queue','◷','Publishing queue'],['agents','⌘','Agent team'],['reports','▥','Reports'],['maps','⌖','Maps & locations'],['assets','▧','Sia & assets'],['plan','≡','Full blueprint'],['settings','⚙','Settings']];
const agentDefs=[['Strategy planner','Monthly','Campaign goals, prior reports → syllabus and measurable learning goals.','Needs historical results'],['Calendar planner','Weekly','Show rules, levels, location pins → dated channel slots and capacity checks.','31 lessons planned'],['Word-bank librarian','On brief creation','90-day history → reserved unique word, meaning and example.','Prior word history required'],['Language & claims reviewer','On script revision','English lines and approved claims → evidence-backed lint report.','Human language review required'],['Platform copy adapter','On script lock','Learning point → native IG/FB/X captions and alt text.','Draft variants ready'],['Reconciliation & recovery','On unknown publish outcome','Remote account state → matched receipt or held incident.','Never blindly reposts'],['Lesson writer','On brief approval','One teaching point → Hinglish script, two hooks and practice answer key.','Draft scripts ready'],['Location director','Before production','Approved map pin → Sia-only scene brief and shot framing.','Waiting for maps'],['Voice producer','On script lock','Approved voice ID + script → timed Sia audio and pronunciation check.','Needs Sia voice source'],['Video producer','On audio QA','Locked Sia + scene + audio → master and channel crops.','Needs media provider'],['Design & captions','On render ready','Video + brand assets → subtitles, end card, thumbnails and story cards.','Template specified'],['Quality reviewer','Before human review','Language, identity, rights, audio, captions and safe zones → pass/fail report.','Cannot grant approval'],['Approval coordinator','Daily at 10:00 IST','QA-passed package → human review task, reminders and version record.','Human decision required'],['Scheduler','Every minute','Approved immutable versions → due jobs with timezone and capacity checks.','Dry run only'],['Publisher','When slot is due','Revalidated approval + media → platform publish receipt or reconciled failure.','No accounts connected'],['Metrics collector','1h / 24h / 72h / 7d','Platform receipts → raw and normalized metric snapshots.','No live metrics'],['Insights analyst','Monday 10:30 IST','Comparable cohorts → winners, weak spots and experiment proposals.','First report after launch'],['Community triage','Twice daily','Comments → quiz answer summary and suggested replies for human review.','Replies never auto-sent'],['Operations guardian','Continuous','Job health, token expiry and spend → holds, alerts and incident tasks.','Budget required']];
let episodes=[], state={edits:{},audit:[],paused:false,role:'Manager',agents:{},pins:[],map:null,mapName:'',selectedLocation:''};try{state={...state,...JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('speakx-prototype-v1')||'{}')}}catch{}
const mapCatalog=[{"id": "delhi", "name": "Delhi · India Gate", "src": "assets/maps/delhi.webp"}, {"id": "hyderabad", "name": "Hyderabad · Charminar & Golconda", "src": "assets/maps/hyderabad.webp"}, {"id": "lucknow", "name": "Lucknow & Kanpur", "src": "assets/maps/lucknow.webp"}, {"id": "patna", "name": "Patna & Vaishali", "src": "assets/maps/patna.webp"}, {"id": "guwahati", "name": "Guwahati & Kamakhya", "src": "assets/maps/guwahati.webp"}, {"id": "jaipur", "name": "Jaipur · Pink City", "src": "assets/maps/jaipur.webp"}, {"id": "agra", "name": "Agra · Taj Mahal", "src": "assets/maps/agra.webp"}, {"id": "varanasi", "name": "Varanasi · Ghats", "src": "assets/maps/varanasi.webp"}, {"id": "indore", "name": "Indore, Ujjain & Mandu", "src": "assets/maps/indore.webp"}, {"id": "gujarat", "name": "Gujarat · Statue of Unity & Gir", "src": "assets/maps/gujarat.webp"}, {"id": "nagpur", "name": "Nagpur · Geographic Centre", "src": "assets/maps/nagpur.webp"}, {"id": "mumbai", "name": "Mumbai · Marine Drive", "src": "assets/maps/mumbai.webp"}, {"id": "pune", "name": "Pune, Lonavala & Khandala", "src": "assets/maps/pune.webp"}, {"id": "odisha", "name": "Odisha · Konark & Puri", "src": "assets/maps/odisha.webp"}, {"id": "bangalore", "name": "Bangalore · Vidhana Soudha", "src": "assets/maps/bangalore.webp"}];
state.mapStates=state.mapStates||{};state.activeMap=state.activeMap||'delhi';if(!state.map){state.map=mapCatalog[0].src;state.mapName=mapCatalog[0].name;state.pins=[{id:'delhi-interview',location:'OFC | Interview Room',x:.083,y:.49,lesson:'SIA-2026-10-01',mapRevision:1,conceptual:true},{id:'delhi-meeting',location:'OFC | Meeting Room',x:.29,y:.213,lesson:'',mapRevision:1,conceptual:true},{id:'delhi-cafe',location:'FND | Café',x:.391,y:.557,lesson:'',mapRevision:1,conceptual:true}];}
let view='overview',selected=null,detailTab='Script',sample=false;
function persist(){try{localStorage.setItem('speakx-prototype-v1',JSON.stringify(state))}catch{toast('Browser storage is full. Export your work; upload a smaller map.')}}
function toast(t){$('#toast').textContent=t;$('#toast').style.display='block';clearTimeout(window.tt);window.tt=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').style.display='none',4200)}
function audit(action,id){state.audit.unshift({at:new Date().toISOString(),actor:state.role,action,id});persist()}
function all(){return episodes.map(e=>({...e,...state.edits[e.id]}))}function byId(id){return all().find(e=>e.id===id)}
function editable(){return state.role!=='Analyst'}function canApprove(){return ['Manager','Approver'].includes(state.role)}
function badge(s){return `<span class="badge ${s.includes('review')?'review':s.includes('Approved')||s.includes('Scheduled')?'approved':''}">${esc(s)}</span>`}
function heading(title,sub,action=''){return `<div class="title"><div><p>${sub}</p><h1>${title}</h1></div>${action}</div>`}
function download(name,text,type='text/plain'){const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([text],{type}));a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href),1000)}
function exportCSV(){const cols=['id','date','day','show','topic','level','location','timeIG','timeFB','status','script','instagram','facebook','xMorning','xEvening','story'];download('SpeakX-October-2026.csv',[cols.join(','),...all().map(e=>cols.map(k=>'"'+String(e[k]??'').replaceAll('"','""')+'"').join(','))].join('\n'),'text/csv')}
function row(e){return `<div class="list-row"><div class="datebox">${e.date.slice(8)}<small>OCT</small></div><div class="grow"><strong>${esc(e.topic)}</strong><small>${esc(e.show)} · ${esc(e.timeIG)} IST · ${e.settingMode==='location'?'On location':'Sia studio'}</small></div>${badge(e.status)}<button data-open="${e.id}">Review</button></div>`}
function initNav(){ $('#nav').innerHTML=items.map(([id,i,n])=>`<a href="#${id}" class="${id===view?'active':''}"><span>${i}</span>${n}</a>`).join('');$('#breadcrumb').textContent=items.find(x=>x[0]===view)?.[2]||'Overview';$('#pause').textContent=state.paused?'Resume demo queue':'Pause demo queue';$('#pause').disabled=!editable()}
function render(){view=location.hash.slice(1)||'overview';if(!items.some(x=>x[0]===view))view='overview';initNav();const fn={overview,creative,calendar,studio,approvals,queue,agents,reports,maps,assets,plan,settings}[view];$('#main').innerHTML=fn();bind();}
function overview(){const a=all();return heading('Small lessons.<br>Everyday confidence.','October 2026 campaign',`<button class="primary" data-go="calendar">Open October calendar</button>`)+`<div class="stats"><article><span>Original Sia lessons</span><strong>${a.length}</strong><small>Every day, October 1–31</small></article><article><span>Planned placements</span><strong>155</strong><small>62 videos · 31 Story sets · 62 X posts</small></article><article><span>Demo approvals</span><strong>${a.filter(e=>e.status.includes('Approved')||e.status.includes('Scheduled')).length}</strong><small>Final media still required</small></article><article><span>Live posts</span><strong>0</strong><small>Accounts not connected</small></article></div><div class="split"><div><section class="panel hero-panel"><div class="copy"><span class="tag">Sia Sikhaati Hai</span><h2 style="margin-top:20px">One familiar face.<br>A world of situations.</h2><p>20 direct studio lessons. 11 real-life settings. Practical English, taught by Sia.</p><button data-go="creative">See the creative direction</button></div><div class="portrait"><img src="assets/sia-board.png" alt="Sia reference portrait"></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="row"><h2>First on the calendar</h2><a href="#studio">All 31 lessons</a></div>${a.slice(0,4).map(row).join('')}</section></div><div><section class="panel"><h2>Before the first post</h2><ul class="checks"><li>Review imported maps and lesson pins</li><li>Supply Sia’s source voice/video and rights record</li><li>Connect Instagram, Facebook and X</li><li>Approve a 10-second Sia identity test</li><li>Review final media and run publishing checks</li></ul><button data-go="settings">View launch setup</button></section><section class="panel"><h2>Weekly teaching rhythm</h2>${[['Mon','Word Wala'],['Tue','Grammar'],['Wed','Ek ya Anek'],['Thu','Baat-Cheet on location'],['Fri','Sentence Banao'],['Sat','Galti Pakdo quiz'],['Sun','Revision + mini test']].map(([d,s])=>`<div class="row" style="padding:6px 0"><span class="subtle">${d}</span><b style="font-size:14px">${s}</b></div>`).join('')}</section></div></div>`}
function creative(){return heading('A familiar face.<br>A reason to come back.','Creative direction for October',`<button data-go="calendar">See the episode mix</button>`)+`<div class="stats"><article><span>Sia-only studio lessons</span><strong>20</strong><small>Direct, clear and personal</small></article><article><span>Sia on location</span><strong>11</strong><small>Language in a useful situation</small></article><article><span>Brief map reveals</span><strong>5</strong><small>Thursday only · one second</small></article><article><span>Complete takeaways</span><strong>31</strong><small>One useful win in every episode</small></article></div><div class="split"><section class="panel hero-panel"><div class="copy"><span class="tag">Most days: just Sia</span><h2>“Where you are going?”<br>Let’s fix one thing.</h2><p>A question. A clear correction. A pause to say it yourself. No map needed.</p></div><div class="portrait"><img src="assets/sia-board.png" alt="Sia studio reference"></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>Occasionally: say it here</h2><p>“Interview mein pehli line par atak jaate ho?”</p><p>Hook with Sia first. A quick map pin on Thursday. Then learn the phrase with Sia in the interview room.</p><span class="tag">6 location lessons skip the map entirely</span></section></div><section class="panel"><h2>The weekly reason to return</h2><div class="flow"><span>Mon · useful word</span><span>Tue / Wed · build the skill</span><span>Thu · use it somewhere</span><span>Fri · make it yours</span><span>Sat · try the challenge</span><span>Sun · see your progress</span></div><p>Answer the question in this episode. Tease a specific next lesson on the end card. Every video stands alone; the weekly journey rewards coming back.</p></section><div class="cards"><section class="panel"><h3>Hook with a real problem</h3><p>“Naam ke baad kya bolun?” beats a generic introduction. Rotate questions, sentence fixes and two-option choices.</p></section><section class="panel"><h3>Give the learner a turn</h3><p>One short prediction or repeat-after-me pause. Saturday challenges; Sunday mini tests. Useful participation, no engagement bait.</p></section><section class="panel"><h3>Let results shape the mix</h3><p>Compare matched studio and location episodes. Watch time, saves and meaningful answers guide the next plan; no promised growth.</p></section></div>`}
function filters(){return `<div class="toolbar"><input id="search" aria-label="Search lessons" placeholder="Search topic, script or location…"><select id="statusFilter" aria-label="Filter status"><option>All statuses</option><option>Planned</option><option>In review</option><option>Changes requested</option><option>Approved demo</option><option>Scheduled demo</option><option>Rejected</option></select><select id="levelFilter" aria-label="Filter level"><option>All levels</option><option>A1</option><option>A2</option><option>B1</option><option>B2</option></select><button id="exportCSV">Export CSV</button></div>`}
function calendar(){return heading('October, all mapped out.','31 lessons · All times in Asia/Kolkata')+filters()+`<div class="toolbar"><span class="pill">Weekdays: IG 19:30 · FB 20:00</span><span class="pill">Weekends: IG 11:00 · FB 11:30</span><span class="pill">X: 08:30 + 19:00 · Stories: 13:00</span></div><div class="calendar-scroll"><div class="calendar" id="calendarGrid">${calendarCells(all())}</div></div><p><b>20 studio lessons · 11 location lessons · just 5 brief map reveals.</b></p><p class="subtle">Select a day to read the complete script, audio direction and channel captions. Slots are proposals, not live schedules.</p>`}
function calendarCells(list){const ids=new Set(list.map(e=>e.id));return ['Mon','Tue','Wed','Thu','Fri','Sat','Sun'].map(d=>`<div class="weekday">${d}</div>`).join('')+'<div class="day blank"></div>'.repeat(3)+all().map(e=>`<button class="day ${['Saturday','Sunday','Sat','Sun'].includes(e.day)?'weekend':''}" data-open="${e.id}" style="opacity:${ids.has(e.id)?1:.2}" ${ids.has(e.id)?'':'disabled'}><span class="number">${Number(e.date.slice(8))}</span><span class="lesson">${esc(e.topic)}</span><small>${e.settingMode==='location'?'On location':'Sia studio'}${e.mapReveal?' · 1s map reveal':''}</small><small>IG ${e.timeIG} · ${esc(e.level)}</small>${badge(e.status)}</button>`).join('')+'<div class="day blank"></div>'}
function studio(){return heading('The content desk.','Scripts, platform copy and production notes')+filters()+`<section class="panel table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Lesson / location</th><th>Format</th><th>Level</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="lessonRows">${tableRows(all())}</tbody></table></section>`}
function tableRows(list){return list.map(e=>`<tr><td>${e.date.slice(8)} Oct<br><small>${esc(e.day)}</small></td><td><b>${esc(e.topic)}</b><small>${esc(e.location)}</small></td><td>Sia video<br><small>${e.duration}s + Story + X</small></td><td>${esc(e.level)}</td><td>${badge(e.status)}</td><td><button data-open="${e.id}">Open lesson</button></td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="6">No lessons match these filters.</td></tr>'}
function approvals(){const list=all().filter(e=>e.status==='In review'||e.status==='Changes requested');return heading('A human has the final word.','Demo review queue')+`<section class="panel"><p>The QA agent checks the package. The manager or approver signs off on the exact version. Edits invalidate that approval.</p><p class="subtle">In this prototype, approvals apply to the planning copy only. No generated media exists yet; nothing can go live.</p>${list.length?list.map(row).join(''):`<div class="empty"><h3>No lessons awaiting review</h3><p>Open a lesson and choose “Send to demo review”.</p><button data-go="studio">Open content studio</button></div>`}</section>`}
function queue(){const list=all().filter(e=>e.status==='Scheduled demo');return heading('The publishing queue.','Independent receipts for Instagram, Facebook and X',`<span class="tag">${state.paused?'Paused':'Dry run only'}</span>`)+`<section class="panel"><h2>Live publishing is blocked</h2><p>Connect accounts, render final media and collect a human approval before activating the production system.</p><div class="flow"><span>Version check</span><span>Approval check</span><span>Media QA</span><span>Account health</span><span>Publish receipt</span></div></section><section class="panel">${list.length?list.map(row).join(''):'<div class="empty"><h3>No demo slots scheduled</h3><p>Approve planning copy, then schedule a demo slot from its lesson.</p></div>'}</section><section class="panel"><h2>Activity log · this browser</h2>${state.audit.slice(0,15).map(a=>`<div class="audit"><b>${esc(a.action)}</b><small>${esc(a.id)} · ${esc(a.actor)} · ${new Date(a.at).toLocaleString('en-IN')}</small></div>`).join('')||'<p class="subtle">Your review and scheduling actions will appear here.</p>'}</section>`}
function agents(){return heading('Your production team.','19 defined agent roles · orchestration design, not running services')+`<p>Each agent has one responsibility. Only the publisher service receives publishing permissions; only a human can approve. Toggles below configure the local prototype.</p><div class="cards">${agentDefs.map(([name,trigger,job,status],i)=>`<article class="panel agent"><span class="number">Agent ${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} · ${trigger}</span><h3>${name}</h3><p>${job}</p><small>${status}</small><label><input type="checkbox" data-agent="${i}" ${state.agents[i]!==false?'checked':''} ${editable()?'':'disabled'}> Enabled in demo configuration</label></article>`).join('')}</div>`}
function reports(){return heading('Learn what earns attention.','Channel, show, topic, level, location and hook',`<button id="sample">${sample?'Hide illustrative report':'Explore illustrative report'}</button>`)+`<div class="stats">${['Reach / views','Average watch time','Save rate','Tracked conversions'].map(x=>`<article><span>${x}</span><strong>—</strong><small>No connected data</small></article>`).join('')}</div>${sample?`<section class="panel"><span class="tag">Illustration only · not SpeakX performance</span><h2 style="margin-top:15px">How a weekly decision report will look</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Example cohort</th><th>Save rate</th><th>Evidence</th><th>Proposed next action</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interview lessons</td><td>4.2%</td><td>Illustrative 3,000 reach, 126 saves</td><td>Test one follow-up lesson</td></tr><tr><td>Grammar lessons</td><td>1.8%</td><td>Illustrative 5,000 reach, 90 saves</td><td>Try a shorter question hook</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="subtle">These numbers demonstrate the calculation only. They are not measured results or recommendations for the actual campaign.</p></section>`:`<section class="panel empty"><h3>Your first results start after publishing</h3><p>Collect 1-hour, 24-hour, 72-hour and 7-day snapshots.<br>Missing metrics stay unavailable, never zero.</p></section>`}<div class="split"><section class="panel"><h2>Monday report checklist</h2><ul class="checks"><li>Best and weakest lessons within each platform</li><li>Watch time and completion where supplied by the API</li><li>Saves, shares and substantive quiz answers</li><li>Results by location, show and learning level</li><li>Spend per approved asset and tracked signup</li><li>One proposed experiment for next week</li></ul><button id="reportExport">Download report template</button></section><section class="panel"><h2>How decisions stay honest</h2><p>Compare posts at the same age. Keep paid and organic results separate. Show sample size and metric availability beside every result.</p><p class="subtle">October is the baseline month. Do not declare a winner from a single post. A proposed change returns to planning and human approval.</p></section></div>`}
const locations={OFC:['Reception','Meeting Room','Conference Room','Cafeteria','Pantry','Coffee Machine Area','Workstation','HR Cabin','Manager Cabin','Interview Room','Waiting Area','Printer Area','Training Room'],FND:['Restaurant','Café','Tea Stall','Bakery','Ice Cream Shop','Juice Center','Street Food Stall','Sweet Shop','Fast Food Outlet'],RET:['Supermarket','Grocery Store','Fruit Shop','Clothing Store','Shoe Store','Electronics Store','Mobile Shop','Pharmacy','Toy Store','Bookstore','Gift Shop','Sports Store','Shopping Mall','Pet Store'],HEA:['Hospital Reception',"Doctor’s Clinic",'Diagnostic Lab','Emergency Room','OPD','Nursing Station','Health Camp','Medical Store','Ambulance Bay'],EDU:['Classroom','School Reception',"Principal’s Office",'Library','Computer Lab','Science Lab','Playground','Staff Room','College Campus','Tuition Center','Coaching Institute','Examination Hall','Cafeteria'],RES:['Living Room','Kitchen','Bedroom','Dining Room','Balcony','Bathroom','Apartment Lobby','Lift','Parking Area','Security Gate','Garden','Terrace',"Neighbor’s House",'Society Clubhouse','Mail Room'],REC:['Park',"Children’s Play Area",'Gym','Swimming Pool','Cinema Hall','Bowling Alley','Game Zone','Cricket Ground','Football Field','Basketball Court','Yoga Studio','Music Class','Dance Studio','Amusement Park','Community Center'],TOU:['Hotel Reception','Hotel Room','Tourist Information Center','Museum','Art Gallery','Fort','Monument','Beach','Boat Dock','Adventure Camp','Wildlife Safari','Souvenir Shop','Heritage Site','Guided Tour Point','On Road'],TR:['Taxi Stand','Auto Stand','Metro Station Entrance','Parking Lot','Toll Plaza','Fuel Station','EV Charging Station','Car Rental Counter','Bicycle Rental','Traffic Signal','Highway Rest Stop','Cab Pickup Point'],AIR:['Entrance Gate','Check-in Counter','Security Check','Immigration','Departure Gate','Boarding Gate','Arrival Hall','Baggage Claim','Information Desk','Lounge','Duty Free Shop','Food Court','Currency Exchange','Taxi Pickup','Lost & Found','Inside Plane'],RLS:['Ticket Counter','Platform','Waiting Room','Foot Over Bridge','Inquiry Counter','Reservation Office','Food Stall','Book Stall','Parcel Office','Exit Gate','Auto Pickup Point','Drinking Water Area','Inside Train'],BUS:['Ticket Counter','Platform','Waiting Area','Snack Stall','Restroom','Auto Stand','Taxi Stand','Information Board','In Bus'],GOV:['Police Station']};
function maps(){const count=Object.values(locations).flat().length;return heading('Sia’s world of English.','Upload your map. Pin a place. Link a lesson.',`<span class="tag">${count} locations · 13 categories</span>`)+`<section class="panel"><div class="toolbar"><select id="mapSelect" aria-label="Choose city map">${mapCatalog.map(m=>`<option value="${m.id}" ${state.activeMap===m.id?'selected':''}>${m.name}</option>`).join('')}${state.activeMap==='upload'?'<option value="upload" selected>Uploaded map</option>':''}</select><label style="margin:0">Map image <input id="mapUpload" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" ${editable()?'':'disabled'}></label><select id="locationSelect" aria-label="Location to pin">${Object.entries(locations).map(([c,names])=>`<optgroup label="${c}">${names.map(n=>`<option value="${esc(c+' | '+n)}" ${state.selectedLocation===c+' | '+n?'selected':''}>${esc(c+' · '+n)}</option>`).join('')}</optgroup>`).join('')}</select><button id="exportPins">Export map pins</button></div><p class="subtle">${state.map?'Click your map to place the selected location. Pins mark conceptual lesson settings, not verified business addresses.':'Awaiting your map images. No invented map or coordinates are shown.'} Uploads stay in this browser; maximum 2 MB. Export your pins before switching devices.</p>${state.map?`<div id="mapCanvas" style="position:relative;line-height:0;width:fit-content;max-width:100%;cursor:crosshair"><img src="${state.map}" alt="${esc(state.mapName)}" style="max-width:100%;display:block">${state.pins.map((p,i)=>`<button class="pin" data-pin="${i}" title="${esc(p.location)}" aria-label="Select pin ${i+1}: ${esc(p.location)}" style="position:absolute;left:${p.x*100}%;top:${p.y*100}%;transform:translate(-50%,-100%);border-radius:50%;background:#ff5000;color:white;width:32px;height:32px;padding:0;border:2px solid white">${i+1}</button>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="empty"><h3>Bring your locations into the calendar</h3><p>Start with an office floor plan or a neighbourhood map.<br>Then place an Interview Room, Meeting Room or Café pin.</p></div>'}</section><section class="panel"><h2>Location pins & linked lessons</h2>${state.pins.map((p,i)=>`<div class="list-row"><div class="grow"><strong>${i+1}. ${esc(p.location)}</strong><small>Map: ${esc(state.mapName)} · x ${p.x.toFixed(3)}, y ${p.y.toFixed(3)}</small></div><select data-linkpin="${i}" aria-label="Lesson for pin ${i+1}"><option value="">Link an October lesson</option>${all().map(e=>`<option value="${e.id}" ${p.lesson===e.id?'selected':''}>Oct ${e.date.slice(8)} · ${esc(e.topic)}</option>`).join('')}</select><button data-delpin="${i}" ${editable()?'':'disabled'}>Remove</button></div>`).join('')||'<p class="subtle">No pins yet. The production design supports multiple maps, revisions and permanent location IDs.</p>'}</section>`}
function assets(){return heading('Sia stays Sia.','Identity, audio and visual references')+`<section class="panel"><img class="asset-board" src="assets/sia-board.png" alt="Sia character board with locked face, hair, outfit, palette and expression references"></section><div class="split"><section class="panel"><h2>Identity lock</h2><p>Use the supplied face, hair and grey mock-neck outfit. Sia is the only visible person and only speaking voice. Counterparts appear as text prompts.</p><p>Locations may change to approved map-linked scenes. No staff, customers, reflected people or background faces.</p><p class="subtle">Character board received. Source video and approved voice profile not yet supplied.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Audio & export package</h2><p>One approved Sia voice; clear Hinglish teaching; quiet licensed ambience. No music that masks the English example.</p><p>Each lesson: audio master, caption transcript, 16:9 master, 9:16 Reel, X crop where planned, thumbnail and QA report.</p><a href="assets/speakx.png" download>Download supplied SpeakX logo</a></section></div>`}
function plan(){return heading('The complete operating plan.','Content, production, engineering and manager handoff')+`<section class="panel docs"><h2>Read the blueprint</h2>${[['creative-direction.md','Creative direction: studio, locations and return-worthy episodes'],['october-content.md','October content calendar & all 31 scripts'],['automation-blueprint.md','Agent architecture, approvals, publishing & operations'],['api-notes.md','Platform integrations & verified API notes'],['manager-guide.md','Manager workflow, UI scope & launch checklist']].map(([f,n])=>`<a href="docs/${f}" data-doc="${f}">${n}<small>Open document</small></a>`).join('')}<a href="october.json" download>Download October content data<small>Machine-readable JSON</small></a><button id="exportCSV">Export calendar as CSV</button></section><div class="panel"><h2>Chosen approach</h2><p>Extend the existing Next.js / Payload system with durable jobs, Postgres, asset storage and separate platform adapters. This prototype defines the manager experience before integration.</p><p>A no-code scheduler is a faster interim option, but needs manual identity QA and approval evidence. A fully custom platform offers flexibility with a larger maintenance burden.</p></div>`}
function settings(){return heading('Ready for the real workflow.','Demo controls and production setup')+`<div class="split"><section class="panel"><h2>Prototype preferences</h2><label for="role">Preview a team role</label><select id="role">${['Manager','Creator','Approver','Analyst'].map(r=>`<option ${state.role===r?'selected':''}>${r}</option>`).join('')}</select><p class="subtle">Role previews demonstrate controls. They are not authentication. Production uses server-enforced permissions and separate logins.</p><button id="backup">Export browser workspace</button><h3 style="margin-top:25px">Publishing mode</h3><p>Dry run is fixed on. No live publishing code or credentials are included.</p><button id="reset">Reset local demo changes</button></section><section class="panel"><h2>Account readiness</h2>${['Instagram professional account','Facebook Page','X account and funded API access','Media provider and approved Sia voice','Team sign-in and durable storage'].map(x=>`<div class="list-row"><span>${x}</span><span class="badge">Not connected</span></div>`).join('')}<p class="subtle">The production manager setup will use secure account connection flows. Do not paste tokens into this prototype.</p></section></div>`}
function openDetail(id,tab='Script'){selected=id;detailTab=tab;const e=byId(id);if(!e)return;const d=$('#detail');d.innerHTML=`<div class="dialog-head"><div><small>${e.date} · ${esc(e.show)} · ${esc(e.level)}</small><h2 style="margin:2px 0">${esc(e.topic)}</h2></div><button id="closeDetail" aria-label="Close lesson">✕</button></div><div class="dialog-body"><div class="detail-grid"><div><div class="preview"><div class="portrait"><img src="assets/sia-board.png" alt="Sia reference image, not generated video"></div><span class="tag">Reference · not a video</span><div class="overlay">${esc(e.target)}</div></div><p class="subtle">${esc(e.location)} · ${e.duration}s planned<br>Only Sia appears and speaks.</p>${badge(e.status)}<p class="subtle">Media generation: not started<br>Voice profile: awaiting source<br>Map: ${e.settingMode==='studio'?'not used in this episode':[...state.pins,...Object.values(state.mapStates).flatMap(m=>m.pins||[])].some(p=>p.lesson===id)?'pin linked in this browser':e.mapReveal?'awaiting approved pin':'no map shown; scene only'}</p></div><div><div class="tabs">${['Script','Channels','Review'].map(t=>`<button data-tab="${t}" class="${tab===t?'selected':''}">${t}</button>`).join('')}</div>${tab==='Script'?`<label for="scriptEdit">Spoken script</label><textarea id="scriptEdit" style="min-height:230px" ${editable()?'':'readonly'}>${esc(e.script)}</textarea><label for="locationEdit">Scene location</label><input id="locationEdit" value="${esc(e.location)}" ${editable()?'':'readonly'}><h3 style="margin-top:18px">Why viewers stay</h3><p>${esc(e.retentionDevice||'One useful takeaway and a practice pause')}</p><h3>Next-episode end card</h3><p>${esc(e.nextEpisodeTease||'Next lesson in the calendar')}</p><h3>Setting & map</h3><p>${e.settingMode==='location'?'Sia alone on location':'Sia alone in the studio'} · ${e.mapReveal?'1-second map reveal after the hook':'No map shown'}</p><h3>Alternate hook</h3><p>${esc(e.hookOptionB)}</p><h3>On-screen direction</h3><p>${esc(e.visualDirections)}</p><h3>Audio direction</h3><p>${esc(e.audio)}</p><h3>Aaj ka Word</h3><p><b>${esc(e.word)}</b> · ${esc(e.meaning)}<br>${esc(e.example)}</p><button id="saveScript" ${editable()?'':'disabled'}>Save planning edits</button>`:tab==='Channels'?`<label for="igEdit">Instagram caption</label><textarea id="igEdit" ${editable()?'':'readonly'}>${esc(e.instagram)}</textarea><label for="fbEdit">Facebook caption</label><textarea id="fbEdit" ${editable()?'':'readonly'}>${esc(e.facebook)}</textarea><h3 style="margin-top:16px">X · 08:30 IST</h3><p>${esc(e.xMorning)}</p><h3>X · 19:00 IST</h3><p>${esc(e.xEvening)}</p><h3>Alt text</h3><p>${esc(e.altText)}</p><h3>Story · 13:00 IST</h3><p>${esc(e.story)}</p><button id="saveChannels" ${editable()?'':'disabled'}>Save captions</button>`:`<h3>Demo planning review</h3><p>No final video exists. This approval demonstrates the workflow for the current script, captions and schedule.</p><label for="note">Reviewer note</label><textarea id="note" ${editable()?'':'readonly'}>${esc(e.note||'')}</textarea><label for="timeEdit">Instagram slot · ${e.date} IST</label><input type="time" id="timeEdit" value="${e.timeIG}" ${editable()?'':'readonly'}><p class="subtle">Facebook ${e.timeFB} IST · X 08:30 / 19:00 IST. Any saved edit sends an approved version back for review.</p><div class="actions"><button id="saveReview" ${editable()?'':'disabled'}>Save note / time</button><button data-action="In review" ${editable()?'':'disabled'}>Send to demo review</button><button data-action="Approved demo" class="primary" ${canApprove()&&e.status==='In review'?'':'disabled'}>Approve demo version</button><button data-action="Changes requested" ${canApprove()&&e.status==='In review'?'':'disabled'}>Request changes</button><button data-action="Rejected" ${canApprove()&&e.status==='In review'?'':'disabled'}>Reject</button><button data-action="Scheduled demo" ${canApprove()&&e.status==='Approved demo'&&!state.paused?'':'disabled'}>Schedule demo slot</button></div><p class="subtle">${e.approvedAt?'Demo approved at '+esc(e.approvedAt):'No demo approval yet.'}</p>`}</div></div></div>`;$('#closeDetail').onclick=()=>d.close();d.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openDetail(id,b.dataset.tab));if($('#saveScript'))$('#saveScript').onclick=()=>saveEdit({script:$('#scriptEdit').value,location:$('#locationEdit').value});if($('#saveChannels'))$('#saveChannels').onclick=()=>saveEdit({instagram:$('#igEdit').value,facebook:$('#fbEdit').value});if($('#timeEdit'))$('#timeEdit').oninput=()=>{d.querySelectorAll('[data-action]').forEach(b=>b.disabled=true);};if($('#saveReview'))$('#saveReview').onclick=()=>{if(!$('#timeEdit').value)return toast('Choose a valid time.');saveEdit({note:$('#note').value,timeIG:$('#timeEdit').value})};d.querySelectorAll('[data-action]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>transition(b.dataset.action));if(!d.open)d.showModal();}
function saveEdit(patch){if(!editable())return;const e=byId(selected);state.edits[selected]={...state.edits[selected],...patch,status:e.status.includes('Approved')||e.status.includes('Scheduled')?'In review':e.status,approvedAt:null};audit('Planning version edited; approval cleared',selected);render();openDetail(selected,detailTab);toast('Saved in this browser. Any existing approval was cleared.');}
function transition(next){if(!editable())return;const e=byId(selected);if(next==='Approved demo'&&(!canApprove()||e.status!=='In review'))return;if(next==='Scheduled demo'&&(!canApprove()||e.status!=='Approved demo'||state.paused))return;state.edits[selected]={...state.edits[selected],status:next,note:$('#note')?.value??e.note,approvedAt:next==='Approved demo'?new Date().toISOString():next==='Scheduled demo'?e.approvedAt:null};audit(next,selected);render();openDetail(selected,'Review');toast(next+' saved. No live post was created.');}
function bind(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-go]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>location.hash=b.dataset.go);document.querySelectorAll('[data-open]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openDetail(b.dataset.open));if($('#exportCSV'))$('#exportCSV').onclick=exportCSV;if($('#search')){$('#search').oninput=filter;$('#statusFilter').onchange=filter;$('#levelFilter').onchange=filter;}document.querySelectorAll('[data-agent]').forEach(b=>b.onchange=()=>{state.agents[b.dataset.agent]=b.checked;audit('Agent demo configuration changed',agentDefs[b.dataset.agent][0])});if($('#sample'))$('#sample').onclick=()=>{sample=!sample;render()};if($('#reportExport'))$('#reportExport').onclick=()=>download('SpeakX-weekly-report-template.md','# SpeakX weekly report\n\nPeriod:\nData through:\nMetric coverage / unavailable metrics:\nChannel cohorts and post age:\nTop lessons and evidence:\nUnderperforming lessons and evidence:\nViews, watch time, saves, shares, comments:\nConversions and attribution window:\nCosts:\nOne experiment (hypothesis, primary metric, minimum sample, guardrail):\nHuman decision:\n');document.querySelectorAll('[data-doc]').forEach(a=>a.onclick=async ev=>{ev.preventDefault();const r=await fetch(a.href);if(!r.ok)return toast('Document is not available.');const t=await r.text();$('#detail').innerHTML=`<div class="dialog-head"><h2>${esc(a.textContent.replace('Open document',''))}</h2><button id="closeDoc">Close</button></div><div class="dialog-body longcopy">${esc(t)}</div>`;$('#closeDoc').onclick=()=>$('#detail').close();$('#detail').showModal()});if($('#role'))$('#role').onchange=()=>{state.role=$('#role').value;persist();render()};if($('#backup'))$('#backup').onclick=()=>download('SpeakX-demo-workspace.json',JSON.stringify({state,episodes:all()},null,2),'application/json');if($('#reset'))$('#reset').onclick=()=>{if(confirm('Reset local planning edits, map pins and activity? Download a workspace backup first if needed.')){localStorage.removeItem('speakx-prototype-v1');location.reload()}};bindMaps();}
function filter(){const q=$('#search').value.toLowerCase(),s=$('#statusFilter').value,l=$('#levelFilter').value;const list=all().filter(e=>(s==='All statuses'||e.status===s)&&(l==='All levels'||e.level===l)&&JSON.stringify(e).toLowerCase().includes(q));if($('#calendarGrid'))$('#calendarGrid').innerHTML=calendarCells(list);if($('#lessonRows'))$('#lessonRows').innerHTML=tableRows(list);document.querySelectorAll('[data-open]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openDetail(b.dataset.open));}
function bindMaps(){if(!$('#mapUpload'))return;$('#mapSelect').onchange=()=>{state.mapStates[state.activeMap]={map:state.map,mapName:state.mapName,pins:state.pins};state.activeMap=$('#mapSelect').value;const saved=state.mapStates[state.activeMap],m=mapCatalog.find(m=>m.id===state.activeMap);state.map=saved?.map||m.src;state.mapName=saved?.mapName||m.name;state.pins=saved?.pins||[];persist();render()};$('#locationSelect').onchange=()=>{state.selectedLocation=$('#locationSelect').value;persist()};$('#mapUpload').onchange=async ev=>{const file=ev.target.files[0];if(!file)return;if(!/^image\/(png|jpeg|webp)$/.test(file.type)||file.size>2*1024*1024)return toast('Choose a PNG, JPG or WebP map smaller than 2 MB.');if(state.activeMap==='upload'&&state.pins.length&&!confirm('Replacing the uploaded map clears its pins. Export pins first if needed.'))return;const reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=()=>{state.mapStates[state.activeMap]={map:state.map,mapName:state.mapName,pins:state.pins};state.activeMap='upload';state.map=reader.result;state.mapName=file.name;state.pins=[];persist();render();toast('Map loaded. Select a location, then click to place its pin.')};reader.readAsDataURL(file)};if($('#mapCanvas'))$('#mapCanvas').onclick=ev=>{if(ev.target.closest('button'))return;if(!editable())return;const box=$('#mapCanvas').getBoundingClientRect();state.pins.push({id:crypto.randomUUID(),location:$('#locationSelect').value,x:Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(ev.clientX-box.left)/box.width)),y:Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(ev.clientY-box.top)/box.height)),lesson:'',mapRevision:1});persist();render()};document.querySelectorAll('[data-pin]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>toast(state.pins[Number(b.dataset.pin)].location));document.querySelectorAll('[data-delpin]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{if(!editable())return;state.pins.splice(Number(b.dataset.delpin),1);persist();render()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-linkpin]').forEach(b=>{b.disabled=!editable();b.onchange=()=>{state.pins[Number(b.dataset.linkpin)].lesson=b.value;persist();toast('Lesson linked to pin in this browser.')}});$('#exportPins').onclick=()=>download('SpeakX-map-pins.json',JSON.stringify({mapName:state.mapName,coordinateSystem:'normalized-image-x-y',pins:state.pins},null,2),'application/json')}
$('#pause').onclick=()=>{if(!editable())return;state.paused=!state.paused;audit(state.paused?'Demo queue paused':'Demo queue resumed','queue');render()};window.addEventListener('hashchange',render);
fetch('october.json').then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw Error();return r.json()}).then(data=>{episodes=Array.isArray(data)?data:data.episodes;render();if(document.modelContext?.registerTool){try{Promise.resolve(document.modelContext.registerTool({name:'read_october_lessons',description:'Read the planned October Sia lessons; does not approve or publish.',inputSchema:{type:'object',properties:{date:{type:'string',pattern:'^2026-10-[0-9]{2}$'}},additionalProperties:false},annotations:{readOnlyHint:true,untrustedContentHint:true},execute(input){if(!input||typeof input!=='object'||Object.keys(input).some(k=>k!=='date')||(input.date&&!/^2026-10-(0[1-9]|[12]\d|3[01])$/.test(input.date)))throw new Error('Valid October date required');return all().filter(e=>!input.date||e.date===input.date).map(({id,date,topic,status})=>({id,date,topic,status}));}})).catch(()=>{})}catch{}}}).catch(()=>{$('#main').innerHTML+='<p class="panel">Calendar data is being prepared. Refresh shortly.</p>';initNav()});
